<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="newchardescription.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="newchardescription">
    <!-- Tier 4 screen #4 (new-character creator) slice 8: the OVERVIEW tab
         (set_description) — the final summary form. Char-tab strip (OVERVIEW
         current) + points line + an edit row (name/gender/height/age/location,
         the editable fields selector-highlighted via a baked "> " marker) +
         scenario/profession lines + six read-only summary panes (stats / skills /
         traits / bionics / misc / gear) + a keybinding guide footer. Render-only
         doc; keyboard owns LEFT/RIGHT (cycle field), UP/DOWN (height/age),
         CONFIRM (edit popup), CHANGE_GENDER, CHOOSE_LOCATION, RANDOMIZE,
         SAVE_TEMPLATE, REROLL_*, NEXT/PREV_TAB, QUIT. Tile preview not drawn. -->
    <div class="panel nc-panel">
        <div class="tabs nc-tabs">
            <div class="item tab" data-for="t : tabs"
                 data-class-selected="t.selected" data-rml="t.name_rml"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="nc-desc-points" data-rml="points_rml"></div>
        <div class="nc-desc-editrow">
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="name_rml"></span>
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="gender_rml"></span>
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="height_rml"></span>
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="age_rml"></span>
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="location_rml"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="nc-desc-sp">
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="scenario_rml"></span>
            <span class="nc-desc-field" data-rml="profession_rml"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="nc-desc-panes">
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="stats_rml"></div>
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="skills_rml"></div>
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="traits_rml"></div>
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="bionics_rml"></div>
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="misc_rml"></div>
            <div class="nc-desc-pane scroll-pane" data-rml="gear_rml"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="nc-desc-guide" data-rml="guide_rml"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="crt-overlay" class="crt"></div>
</body>
</rml>
